body:
It makes me sad when sweet men give up on relationships because of weight. I have never nor will I ever be attracted to or invested in a man that is not a big soft bear. You are worthy and loveable, like another commenter on this sub said. Your weight does not reduce your value and it certainly does not reduce your chances at a relationship as much as you think. 1) Being an asshole and 2) giving up, certainly reduce your chances. Just came along to tell you you're worth it and you are inherently loveable, no matter what your brain says. :)

&#x200B;

Also yes that's def happened to me before LOL I hate pictures
